// Vec<PartDef>: the first-release part catalogue (DESIGN.md L136-151, L539-553, L801-807). Unit
// `data-parts-act1` owns this file. Licensed CC BY 4.0.
//
// 66 parts in 5 tiers: 7 guns, 4 missile launchers, 2 torpedo tube sets (the third underwater weapon is the
// mine the mine rail lays), 5 defence systems, 2 drone bays, 8 sensors and 38 hull and system parts. Tier 1 is
// open at campaign start, tiers 2 and 3 open inside Act 1 (150 t), tier 4 in Act 2 (400 t) and tier 5 in Act 3
// (900 t); sandbox, skirmish and PvP offer every row. Phase `Slice` marks the rows the vertical slice needs
// (tutorial, 22 m fast attack craft, the splash patrol boat); everything else is `R010`. Heavy guns, depth
// charge racks and the helicopter deck arrive in the later act files.
//
// Units: mass_kg is dry mass (fuel, ammunition, ballast water and munitions are added from their own rows);
// cost is Salvage, scaled with mass and tier from the 1,000 S anchor for a fitted 150 t hull (L820). Power
// ports are kW, fuel ports L/s and litres. Footprints are 0.5 m cells along (bow, up, starboard). Default power
// priorities follow the table at L287-295. Every part that draws power has a Power `Consume` port, and every
// part an officer commands has a Data `Link`.
//
// Guns. Damage per hit comes from the calibre band (L565-580), so mounts in one band differ in rate of fire,
// dispersion, ammunition, weight and price. The 20 mm is light and cheap but scatters; the 30 mm matches its
// hits per minute with tighter groups and twice the endurance; the 40 mm hits about twice as often at 3 km for
// more than twice the weight. The 57 mm fires faster and wider, the 76 mm slower and tighter, which evens out
// at medium range. The 100 mm suits a 400 t hull's weight budget; the 127 mm is tighter and carries ammunition
// for twice as long. Autocannon mounts carry their whole load as ready rounds; medium and large guns feed from
// a magazine of their calibre through a hoist (L283). The 76 mm magazine holds the spec's 1,800 kg (L666).
[
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    // Guns
    (
        id: "gun.20mm.single", name: "part.gun.20mm.single.name", description: "part.gun.20mm.single.desc",
        category: Gun, tier: T1, phase: Slice, size: (3, 3, 3), placement: Weather, mass_kg: 900.0, cost: 25,
        ports: [(network: Power, role: Consume, rate: 4.0), (network: Data, role: Link)], power_priority: 3,
        flammable: Ammunition,
        function: Gun((calibre_mm: 20, band: Auto, barrels: 1, rof_rpm: 450.0, muzzle_mps: 1050.0, shell_kg: 0.12,
            train_rate_dps: 70.0, elevation_rate_dps: 60.0, elevation_min_deg: -15.0, elevation_max_deg: 70.0,
            dispersion_mrad: 3.5, ready_rounds: 600)),
        model: (generator: "gun.open", params: [20.0, 1.0]), icon: "part_gun",
