    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    // Ammunition handling. Magazines are watertight, count as ammunition for fire, and cook off by their
    // stored mass (L666): 1,800 kg of 76 mm gives 16 cells; 13,500 kg of 127 mm reaches the 24-cell cap.
